      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "CN1",
      "originalText": "国内模型为主\n→ 阿里云 / 腾讯云内地：常驻网关（Higress 或自写）+ Redis\n别用函数计算 / 云函数，边缘函数只挡在前面",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kmrKxhx5wmuK2YKHKLCaF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 110.00779724121094,
