      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "量小、不想运维\n→ Cloudflare Workers + 每个 key 一个 DO\n账务按月分库或外接数据库，日志关掉 payload",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
